{"id":"e_tat","lemma":"état","pos":"noun","rank":395,"glosses":["state, condition","status"],"ipa":"/e.ta/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/10/Fr-%C3%A9tat.ogg/Fr-%C3%A9tat.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"états"},"formAudio":{"états":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e5/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-%C3%A9tats.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Laisse la pièce en état.","en":"Leave the room as it is.","words":[{"g":"to leave","l":"laisser"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"room in a house, etc."},{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"C'est encore en bon état.","en":"It's still in good condition.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"still"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"good"},null]},{"text":"Je suis en état de choc.","en":"I'm in a state of shock.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"in / of it"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"shock"]]},{"text":"Ne te mets pas dans tous tes états.","en":"Don't get hysterical.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1102757","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to put","l":"mettre"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"all"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"Tu es vraiment en mauvais état.","en":"You're really in bad shape.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"are","l":"être"},{"g":"truly"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"bad"},null]}]}